					Post by: <b>martyfever</b> on <b>September 01, 2007, 01:08:42 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Hi Infi-Note, you can get hold of me at Jupiter studio- 206 6331363, it&#039;s in Wallingford. If that&#039;s hard for you to drop by then you could send it to my P.O. box- 99443, Seattle, WA, 98139-0443. I&#039;d like a data CDR of the mix, make sure the mix is not clipped/maxed out and I&#039;d prefer it to have no DSP/limiting done to it, make sure to note on it the file type/sample rate and bit depth.<br />looking forward to it,<br />Martin</div>
